{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The seas were calm. Your mission, simple. And then, everything changed. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, a restless dread grips you and your crew. Deep down, you feel it - something <i>unwanted</i> is on board.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.poster.avif?t=1761521821\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.webm?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.mp4?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Second-in-Command</strong> of the <strong>33rd Fleet</strong>: now only a single Warship, but still a respected and feared one. Alongside your Captain and Third-in-Command, you lead the crew through treacherous waters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.poster.avif?t=1761521821\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.webm?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.mp4?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your primary goal is the extraction of an anomaly lost at sea.</strong><br> There are <strong>four locations</strong>--but only <strong>three days</strong> to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secrets you miss may never reveal themselves again:<br><strong><i>Choose wisely.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.poster.avif?t=1761521821\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.webm?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.mp4?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrangle the crew, preserve loyalties, and protect your sanity.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea may not be your only enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the mystery, or die trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose a side, don't look back.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703340?t=1761521821","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703340?t=1761521821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/39f8dc6dc9fecfc0b8db12391737311704ccc3ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761521821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/39f8dc6dc9fecfc0b8db12391737311704ccc3ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761521821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes 2D depictions of violence, scenes involving corpses, and a generally tense atmosphere with potentially disturbing content. "},"demos":[{"appid":3789550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The seas were calm. Your mission, simple. And then, everything changed. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, a restless dread grips you and your crew. Deep down, you feel it - something <i>unwanted</i> is on board.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.poster.avif?t=1761521821\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.webm?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.mp4?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Second-in-Command</strong> of the <strong>33rd Fleet</strong>: now only a single Warship, but still a respected and feared one. Alongside your Captain and Third-in-Command, you lead the crew through treacherous waters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.poster.avif?t=1761521821\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.webm?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.mp4?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your primary goal is the extraction of an anomaly lost at sea.</strong><br> There are <strong>four locations</strong>--but only <strong>three days</strong> to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secrets you miss may never reveal themselves again:<br><strong><i>Choose wisely.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.poster.avif?t=1761521821\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.webm?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.mp4?t=1761521821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrangle the crew, preserve loyalties, and protect your sanity.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea may not be your only enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the mystery, or die trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose a side, don't look back.</i></p>","developers":["Victoria Rafaelian"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/cc6ec4a4a7e0cb8ef8778afaf387eb2272ffb336/header.jpg?t=1761521821","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Captain Edge Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703340/1400980646/d53e26853a5e51bd9f4539